{"id":"vod_sn_39070","vodId":"39070","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"突击莉莉","name_cn":"突击莉莉","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1e07f879aa0b6bd47f57a619fb85954c.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在未来世界之中，彼时，一种凭空出现的名叫“HUGE”的生命体让人类的命运走到了濒临灭绝的边缘。就在此时，世界各国联合起来发明了能够同HUGE抗衡的武器，而只用这些武器的少女面则被称之为莉莉。　　很快，在世界各地便建立起了培养莉莉的专门学校“Garden”，每个学校都有着自己的名字和特点，我们的女主角一柳梨璃（赤尾光 培养）便就读于百合丘女学院。待人冷淡极具个性的白井梦结（夏吉优子 配音）、含着金汤匙出生的千金大小姐努韦尔（井泽美香子 配音）、拥有超高智商和广阔的知识面的二川二水（西本里美 配音），在学校里，梨璃结识了这些并肩作战的同伴们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RHGTk7Dd5v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vqc6PUari31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tyj2N2LHAp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fbvRkA1xeC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AGCYAKqgqy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t6JWtzcw1y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qDppiYBM5Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TJax5KsrVX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fWsWzm9idx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PnMnt3UMFz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KbHdLeGDdp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MVPK1rMFKZ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:50.868Z"}